on Wait ticks
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 18 .............................. startTimer()
  [  4] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  7] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [  9] getparam 0 .............................. <ticks>
  [ 11] lt ...................................... <the timer < ticks>
  [ 12] jmpifz [ 21] ............................ repeat while the timer < ticks
  [ 15] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 17] extcall 19 .............................. nothing()
  [ 19] endrepeat [  4]
  [ 21] ret
end
